###  http://w3id.org/trajecto/purpose#TransportationPurpose
:TransportationPurpose rdf:type owl:Class ;
                       rdfs:subClassOf :PurposeCategory ;
                       rdfs:comment "Movement purpose primarily related to transport and transit between locations."@en ;
                       rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://w3id.org/trajecto/purpose> ;
                       rdfs:label "Transportation Purpose"@en ;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Movement motivated primarily by the need to travel between locations rather than activities at those locations."@en ;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Commuting, transit transfers, wandering"@en .


###  http://w3id.org/trajecto/purpose#Wandering
:Wandering rdf:type owl:Class ;
